# 🧪 Testing Mindset

Testing is treated as a core engineering skill, not an afterthought.

```text
Production Code
      ↓
Test Data
      ↓
Test Method
      ↓
Test.startTest()
      ↓
Execute Code
      ↓
Test.stopTest()
      ↓
Assertions
      ↓
Code Coverage
```

The goal is to learn how to test behavior and business outcomes, not merely increase coverage percentage.

